OL,3,GNEWSATwo taken to hospital after city
OL,4,Acentre stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fafter a stabbing in Nottingham city
OL,8,Fcentre.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police was called to
OL,11,Freports of an altercation in Huntingdon
OL,12,FStreet shortly before 05:00 BST on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FThe force said two male victims were
OL,16,Ffound in nearby Nile Street. Both were
OL,17,Ftaken to hospital with injuries that
OL,18,Fare not life-threatening or
OL,19,Flife-altering.
OL,21,FNo arrests have been made and a cordon
OL,22,Fremains in place.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
